# The G14 runs the same gate about twice as fast (unit gate median 237 s against about 500 s on the agents) and was Ready 100% of
# the last 20 days, so jobs go there first. If it is down, NotReady or full, the preference does not apply and the pod goes to an
# agent. A pinned --node ignores it, and a profile with prefer_nodes = false (the coordinator journeys) leaves it out. 2026-11-08, Michael,
# ask 765.
PREFER_NODES = ("cartwmic-g14-wsl",)
